        <summary>
            Subscribes to alert requests from the associated window's pages.
            Implementations must be idempotent: calling <see cref="M:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Platform.IAlertManager.Subscribe" /> when already
            subscribed must be a safe no-op, as the framework may call it without a preceding
            <see cref="M:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Platform.IAlertManager.Unsubscribe" /> when a page with an already-attached handler is assigned
            to the window.
            </summary>
